# Generated, not source: deterministic build products of tools/ (see docs/).
# tiny-qwen4exp.gguf is ~113 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB file limit -- regenerate with
#   python tools/make_tiny_model.py
bench/tiny-*.gguf
bench/wide-*.gguf
bench/micro/*.exe
bench/micro/*.obj
bench/micro/*.bin
bench/micro/*.dll
bench/micro/*.txt
*.log
build*/
pack/
logs/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc

# plan v0.3 P1 (repository hygiene, review E1): profiler captures and large diagnostic dumps stay out of git.
# the engine's stall watchdog writes one beside its working directory whenever a request runs long enough to be called
# stalled - every thread's stack, to read against the build's PDB (generate.cpp:1255 stall_report, :1289, issue #31).
# It names the file after its own pid, so these accumulate in the tree after every stall.
*.nsys-rep
strata-stall-*.dmp

# Pi harness metadata (local session state, not project source)
*.sqlite
*.npz
*.occ1
td.log

